~ start
match PlayerStats.scene_progress
	when 1
		if not PlayerStats.has_placed_bibingka
			Max: I better store the bibingka in the refrigerator.
			Max: It's easy to heat up anyways.
			do show_sprite("bibingka")
			$> PlayerStats.has_placed_bibingka = true
		else
			Max: Rest well in cold slumber, my precious little babies.
	when 4
		if not PlayerStats.has_placed_bibingka
			Max: ...Will this bibingka also rot just like them?
			do show_sprite("bibingka")
			$> PlayerStats.has_placed_bibingka = true
		else
			Max: ...
=> END